<div style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; color: #1e293b;">
  <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #e11d48; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #e11d48; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">
      [MACPROTEC PROCESS ENGINEERING]
    </span>
    <h2 style="margin: 6px 0 0 0; color: #0f172a; font-size: 20px; text-transform: uppercase;">
      Thank You For Reaching Out, <%= name %>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155;">
    We have received your <%= type.toLowerCase() %> inquiry and registered it with our Houston engineering technical desk.
  </p>

  <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 18px; margin: 20px 0;">
    <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #475569;">
      <strong>Inquiry Summary:</strong>
    </p>
    <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.6;">
      <div><strong>Subject:</strong> <%= subject || "Engineering Inquiry" %></div>
      <% if (sector) { %><div><strong>Sector:</strong> <%= sector %></div><% } %>
      <% if (budget) { %><div><strong>Target Budget:</strong> <%= budget %></div><% } %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155;">
    Our mechanical process engineering leads review all incoming telemetry and scopes within <strong>24 to 48 business hours</strong>. If your requirement requires an immediate design audit or emergency shutdown review, you can also calendar a direct virtual session or call our Houston direct line.
  </p>

  <div style="margin-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">
    <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0;"><strong>MacProtec Engineering Inc.</strong></p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0;">1000 Louisiana St, Suite 4300, Houston, TX 77002</p>
    <p style="margin: 0;">Phone: +1 (713) 555-0190 | Email: contact@macprotec.com</p>
  </div>
</div>
